flowchart TD
  Create[创建订单 多 SKU 同事务预占] --> Pay[PENDING_PAYMENT]
  Pay -->|模拟付款| Pending[PENDING_SHIPMENT]
  Pay -->|取消 释放预占| Cancel[CANCELED]
  Pending -->|取消 释放预占| Cancel
  Pending -->|仓库发货 同减实物与预占| Ship[SHIPPED]
  Ship -->|后台模拟确认收货 不动库存| Done[COMPLETED]
  Done -->|单条明细部分退货申请| Review[PENDING_REVIEW]
  Review -->|拒绝 恢复可申请数量| Reject[REJECTED]
  Review -->|审核通过| Receipt[PENDING_RECEIPT]
  Receipt -->|异常备注 状态不变| Receipt
  Receipt -->|全部验收合格 实物入库| Returned[售后 COMPLETED 原订单不变]
